{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of modern warfare in <strong>Bullet Horizon: Covert Ops</strong>, a mission-based VR action experience where precision and strategy are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an elite covert agent, you\u2019re tasked with completing high-stakes operations behind enemy lines \u2014 rescuing hostages, sabotaging facilities, eliminating key targets, and infiltrating fortified compounds. Each mission challenges you to think tactically, plan your approach, and adapt to dynamic combat situations with no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/b81980c8d4f4337ca5d501aa9c26f7b9.poster.avif?t=1773318287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/b81980c8d4f4337ca5d501aa9c26f7b9.webm?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/b81980c8d4f4337ca5d501aa9c26f7b9.mp4?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for <strong>virtual reality</strong>, Bullet Horizon: Covert Ops delivers full <strong>hand-tracking, realistic weapon handling</strong>, and deeply <strong>interactive environments</strong>\u00a0that react to your every move. Feel the tension of every encounter through responsive <strong>haptic feedback</strong>, and immerse yourself in a world where every action \u2014 from breaching a door to steadying your aim \u2014 feels authentic and grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.poster.avif?t=1773318287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.webm?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.mp4?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With numerous missions set across a sprawling industrial and urban war zone, every operation offers unique objectives and multiple ways to complete them. The focus isn\u2019t just on firepower \u2014 it\u2019s on execution, precision, and the thrill of outsmarting your enemies under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.poster.avif?t=1773318287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.webm?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.mp4?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a <strong>seasoned FPS veteran</strong>\u00a0or a <strong>newcomer to VR combat</strong>, <strong>Bullet Horizon: Covert Ops</strong>\u00a0delivers a deeply engaging tactical experience that rewards skill, patience, and the art of stealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097160?t=1773318287","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/51f61738f0e00f381c341c74e8625644ff9eb628/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773318287","capsule_image"