cking, realistic weapon handling</strong>, and deeply <strong>interactive environments</strong>\u00a0that react to your every move. Feel the tension of every encounter through responsive <strong>haptic feedback</strong>, and immerse yourself in a world where every action \u2014 from breaching a door to steadying your aim \u2014 feels authentic and grounded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.poster.avif?t=1773318287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.webm?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/21e17a13483e0c922d2586d367857ecd.mp4?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With numerous missions set across a sprawling industrial and urban war zone, every operation offers unique objectives and multiple ways to complete them. The focus isn\u2019t just on firepower \u2014 it\u2019s on execution, precision, and the thrill of outsmarting your enemies under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.poster.avif?t=1773318287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.webm?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097160/extras/91b7cc51603bd51d57d4392598b6198d.mp4?t=1773318287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"